   "title": "Start here",
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Krea 2 - Batch\n\n1. **Prompt List** (stage 1): one prompt per line, or a .txt file in `ComfyUI/input/` named in `prompts_file` (the sample `krea2_batch_prompts.txt` is there).\n2. **Run** once. Every line becomes an image in `ComfyUI/output/krea2_batch/`, plus a contact sheet of the set.\n\nSeeds go up by one per line (`seed_mode`), so each image differs and the whole batch can be reproduced.\n\n**Red nodes are the ones you set.** Stages run left to right with a note under each.\n\nFull instructions: https://github.com/tenitsky/krea2-image"
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
